(text "FACTORY-ASSEMBLED SERVICE POINTS: Keystone 5015 / C2906768" (at 25.4 124.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4) (bold yes)) (justify left)) (uuid "93bc41bc-2d6a-54b5-b74a-b1e0cf3a14a8"))
(text "TP901 / TP902 replace the optional J302 header: regulated 5 V bench input only. Disconnect all USB power before injection.\nNo source selection or reverse-polarity protection. Use current limiting; probe loops are not a strain-relieved power connector.\nTP903-TP908 are in the rear service areas: 3.3 V rails, host UART and local grounds. All eight loops are factory SMT placements." (at 25.4 162.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid "39cc5f65-0526-5c69-aa02-becd4f854f53"))
)
